# Attaches PerContextDatabaseIsolationCustomizer to every test context (aggregated with Spring's
# built-in ContextCustomizerFactory SPI entries — this adds to them, does not replace them).
# It gives each `test`-profile create-drop context its own database on a shared Postgres container
# so a context's create-drop teardown can't drop a cached sibling's schema. See the customizer.
org.springframework.test.context.ContextCustomizerFactory=\
  com.federated.fl_platform_api.testsupport.PerContextDatabaseIsolationCustomizerFactory
